{"id":"cuadro","lemma":"cuadro","pos":"noun","rank":1949,"glosses":["square (a polygon with four straight sides of equal length and four right angles)","rectangle (any quadrilateral having opposing sides parallel and four right angles)","picture, painting or other work of art, especially one in a frame"],"ipa":"/ˈkwadɾo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cuadros"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c2/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-cuadro.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Pueden ver el cuadro?","en":"Can you see the picture?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78856"},{"text":"¿Quién pintó estos cuadros?","en":"Who painted these pictures?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524433"},{"text":"¿Cómo conseguiste ese cuadro?","en":"How did you come by this painting?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/514777"},{"text":"Estos cuadros son bonitos.","en":"These pictures are beautiful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/534719"},{"text":"Él está pintando un cuadro.","en":"He is painting a picture.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/34491"}]}